{%- render 'blko-fonts-linen', tokens: s.tokens -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Model info 01, two (or more) models with a height ruler and a measurement sheet (linen preset; DS
  registry/model-info/model-info-01.tsx). From 768px: photo 6/12 (4:5), a slim height ruler in column 7 whose accent
  marker sits at the picked model's height, and in 8 to 12: product line, heading, lead, the model rows (radio
  buttons: thumb, name, "5'2", wears XS"), the measurement sheet (height with cm, bust, waist, hips, usual size,
  wearing), the fit line, "Shop size XS" and a size guide link. Phones: intro, the model rows two up, photo, sheet;
  the ruler hides.
  Live models, first found wins: (1) the metaobject list product.metafields.custom.models, fields name, height_in
  (inches), bust, waist, hips, usual_size, size, fit, image; (2) the metafields custom.model_height (inches, or cm when
  100 or more) + custom.model_size: one model on the product image; (3) the section's Model blocks. "Shop size X" links
  to the product with ?variant= the first variant whose options include that size (else the product). The product
  setting, else the page's product. Preview (Theme Editor or no template, no product): the Model blocks and the preview
  settings. Live with no product: nothing renders.
  Motion (html.blko-ui-motion): the photo settles in (.96 → 1, 800ms) while the ruler's ticks draw up (900ms) and the
  marker climbs to the height (1000ms). Picking another model crossfades the photo (600ms), slides the marker (700ms)
  and lifts the new figures in (8px, 400ms). Buttons never move. Static = the frame with the first model picked.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign p = s.product | default: product
  assign live = false
  assign preview = false
  if p != blank
    assign live = true
  elsif request.design_mode or template == blank
    assign preview = true
  endif
  assign low = s.ruler_low
  assign high = s.ruler_high
  if high <= low
    assign high = low | plus: 12
  endif
  assign span = high | minus: low
  assign blocks = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'model'
  assign meta_models = nil
  assign source = 'blocks'
  if live
    assign meta_models = p.metafields.custom.models.value
    if meta_models != blank
      assign source = 'meta'
    elsif p.metafields.custom.model_height != blank and p.metafields.custom.model_size != blank
      assign source = 'simple'
    endif
  endif
  assign sep = '~|~'
  capture rows
    if source == 'meta'
      for m in meta_models
        echo m.name | append: sep | append: m.height_in | append: sep | append: m.bust | append: sep | append: m.waist | append: sep | append: m.hips | append: sep | append: m.usual_size | append: sep | append: m.size | append: sep | append: m.fit | append: sep
        if m.image.value != blank
          echo m.image.value | image_url: width: 1400 | append: sep | append: m.image.value.alt
        else
          echo p.featured_media.preview_image | image_url: width: 1400 | append: sep | append: p.featured_media.alt
        endif
        echo '~#~'
      endfor
    elsif source == 'simple'
      assign hraw = p.metafields.custom.model_height.value | plus: 0
      if hraw >= 100
        assign hraw = hraw | divided_by: 2.54 | round
      endif
      echo s.simple_name | append: sep | append: hraw | append: sep | append: sep | append: sep | append: sep | append: sep | append: p.metafields.custom.model_size.value | append: sep | append: sep
      echo p.featured_media.preview_image | image_url: width: 1400 | append: sep | append: p.featured_media.alt
      echo '~#~'
    else
      for b in blocks
        assign bs = b.settings
        echo bs.name | append: sep | append: bs.height_in | append: sep | append: bs.bust | append: sep | append: bs.waist | append: sep | append: bs.hips | append: sep | append: bs.usual | append: sep | append: bs.size | append: sep | append: bs.fit | append: sep
        if bs.image != blank
          echo bs.image | image_url: width: 1400 | append: sep | append: bs.image.alt
        else
          echo '' | append: sep | append: bs.alt
        endif
        echo '~#~'
      endfor
    endif
  endcapture
  assign models = rows | strip | remove_last: '~#~' | split: '~#~'
-%}
{%- capture ft_tpl -%}[f]'[i]"{%- endcapture -%}
<div class="bmodelinfo01" data-tokens="{{ s.tokens }}" style="--pt:{{ s.padding_top }}px;--pb:{{ s.padding_bottom }}px" data-bmodelinfo01
  >{%- if live or preview -%}{%- if models.size > 0 -%}
  <section class="bmodelinfo01__grid" aria-label="{{ s.label | escape }}"
    ><div class="bmodelinfo01__intro"
      >{%- if s.product_line != blank -%}<p class="bmodelinfo01__line">{{ s.product_line | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
      <h2 class="bmodelinfo01__title">{{ s.heading | escape }}</h2
      >{%- if s.lead != blank -%}<p class="bmodelinfo01__lead">{{ s.lead | escape }}</p>{%- endif -%}
    </div

    ><div class="bmodelinfo01__picks" role="radiogroup" aria-label="{{ s.pick_label | escape }}"
      >{%- for row in models -%}
        {%- assign f = row | strip | split: sep -%}
        {%- assign h = f[1] | plus: 0 -%}
        {%- assign hf = h | divided_by: 12 | floor -%}{%- assign hi = h | modulo: 12 -%}
        {%- assign hft = ft_tpl | replace: '[f]', hf | replace: '[i]', hi -%}
        {%- assign at = high | minus: h | times: 100.0 | divided_by: span -%}
        {%- if at < 0 -%}{%- assign at = 0 -%}{%- elsif at > 100 -%}{%- assign at = 100 -%}{%- endif -%}
        <button type="button" class="bmodelinfo01__pick" role="radio" aria-checked="{% if forloop.first %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}" data-pick="{{ forloop.index0 }}" data-at="{{ at }}" data-ft="{{ hft | escape }}"
          >{%- if f[8] != blank -%}<img class="bmodelinfo01__thumb" src="{{ f[8] | replace: 'width=1400', 'width=160' }}" alt="" width="56" height="70" loading="lazy">{%- else -%}<span class="bmodelinfo01__thumb">{{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}</span>{%- endif -%}
          <span class="bmodelinfo01__pick-text"
            ><span class="bmodelinfo01__pick-name">{{ f[0] | escape }}</span
            ><span class="bmodelinfo01__pick-meta">{{ s.row_text | replace: '[height]', hft | replace: '[size]', f[6] | escape }}</span
          ></span
        ></button
      >{%- endfor -%}
    </div

    ><div class="bmodelinfo01__photo" data-photo
      >{%- for row in models -%}
        {%- assign f = row | strip | split: sep -%}
        {%- if f[8] != blank -%}
          <img class="bmodelinfo01__shot{% if forloop.first %} is-on{% endif %}" data-shot src="{{ f[8] }}" srcset="{{ f[8] | replace: 'width=1400', 'width=800' }} 800w, {{ f[8] }} 1400w" sizes="(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw" alt="{{ f[9] | escape }}"{% unless forloop.first %} aria-hidden="true"{% endunless %} width="1400" height="1750"{% unless forloop.first %} loading="lazy"{% endunless %}
        >{%- else -%}
          <span class="bmodelinfo01__shot{% if forloop.first %} is-on{% endif %}" data-shot>{{ 'lifestyle-2' | placeholder_svg_tag }}</span
        >{%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div

    ><div class="bmodelinfo01__ruler" aria-hidden="true"
      ><p class="bmodelinfo01__ruler-label">{{ s.ruler_label | escape }}</p
      ><div class="bmodelinfo01__scale"
        ><div class="bmodelinfo01__ticks" data-ticks
          ><span class="bmodelinfo01__axis"></span
          >{%- for i in (0..span) -%}
            {%- assign n = high | minus: i -%}
            {%- assign top = i | times: 100.0 | divided_by: span -%}
            {%- assign mark = n | modulo: 4 -%}
            <span class="bmodelinfo01__tick" style="top:{{ top }}%"
              ><span class="bmodelinfo01__tick-line{% if mark == 2 %} is-long{% endif %}"></span
              >{%- if mark == 2 -%}{%- assign tf = n | divided_by: 12 | floor -%}{%- assign ti = n | modulo: 12 -%}<span class="bmodelinfo01__tick-label">{{ ft_tpl | replace: '[f]', tf | replace: '[i]', ti }}</span>{%- endif -%}
            </span
          >{%- endfor -%}
        </div
        >{%- assign f0 = models.first | strip | split: sep -%}
        {%- assign h0 = f0[1] | plus: 0 -%}
        {%- assign at0 = high | minus: h0 | times: 100.0 | divided_by: span -%}
        {%- if at0 < 0 -%}{%- assign at0 = 0 -%}{%- elsif at0 > 100 -%}{%- assign at0 = 100 -%}{%- endif -%}
        {%- assign f0f = h0 | divided_by: 12 | floor -%}{%- assign f0i = h0 | modulo: 12 -%}
        <div class="bmodelinfo01__mark" data-mark style="translate:0 {{ at0 }}%"
          ><span class="bmodelinfo01__mark-in"><span class="bmodelinfo01__mark-line"></span><span class="bmodelinfo01__mark-tag" data-mark-tag>{{ ft_tpl | replace: '[f]', f0f | replace: '[i]', f0i }}</span></span
        ></div
      ></div
    ></div

    ><div class="bmodelinfo01__sheets"
      >{%- for row in models -%}
        {%- assign f = row | strip | split: sep -%}
        {%- assign h = f[1] | plus: 0 -%}
        {%- assign hf = h | divided_by: 12 | floor -%}{%- assign hi = h | modulo: 12 -%}
        {%- assign hft = ft_tpl | replace: '[f]', hf | replace: '[i]', hi -%}
        {%- assign hcm = h | times: 2.54 | round | append: '' -%}
        {%- assign size = f[6] -%}
        {%- assign href = '#' -%}
        {%- if live -%}
          {%- assign href = p.url -%}
          {%- for x in p.variants -%}{%- if x.options contains size -%}{%- assign href = p.url | append: '?variant=' | append: x.id -%}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- assign btn = s.button_label | replace: '[size]', size -%}
        <div class="bmodelinfo01__sheet" data-sheet="{{ forloop.index0 }}" aria-live="polite"{% unless forloop.first %} hidden{% endunless %}
          ><dl class="bmodelinfo01__dl"
            ><div class="bmodelinfo01__fig bmodelinfo01__fig--h" data-fig style="--i:0"><dt>{{ s.label_height | escape }}</dt><dd>{{ s.height_format | replace: '[height]', hft | replace: '[cm]', hcm | escape }}</dd></div
            >{%- if f[2] != blank -%}<div class="bmodelinfo01__fig" data-fig style="--i:1"><dt>{{ s.label_bust | escape }}</dt><dd>{{ s.unit_format | replace: '[n]', f[2] | escape }}</dd></div>{%- endif -%}
            {%- if f[3] != blank -%}<div class="bmodelinfo01__fig" data-fig style="--i:2"><dt>{{ s.label_waist | escape }}</dt><dd>{{ s.unit_format | replace: '[n]', f[3] | escape }}</dd></div>{%- endif -%}
            {%- if f[4] != blank -%}<div class="bmodelinfo01__fig" data-fig style="--i:3"><dt>{{ s.label_hips | escape }}</dt><dd>{{ s.unit_format | replace: '[n]', f[4] | escape }}</dd></div>{%- endif -%}
            {%- if f[5] != blank -%}<div class="bmodelinfo01__fig" data-fig style="--i:4"><dt>{{ s.label_usual | escape }}</dt><dd>{{ f[5] | escape }}</dd></div>{%- endif -%}
            <div class="bmodelinfo01__fig" data-fig style="--i:5"><dt>{{ s.label_wearing | escape }}</dt><dd>{{ size | escape }}</dd></div
          ></dl
          >{%- if f[7] != blank -%}<p class="bmodelinfo01__fit" data-fig><span class="bmodelinfo01__fit-who">{{ s.fit_prefix | replace: '[name]', f[0] | escape }} </span><span class="bmodelinfo01__muted">{{ f[7] | escape }}</span></p>{%- endif -%}
          <div class="bmodelinfo01__actions"
            >{%- render 'blko-ui-button', href: href, size: 'lg', shape: 'pill', children: btn -%}
            {%- if s.guide_label != blank -%}<a href="{{ s.guide_url | default: '#' }}" class="bmodelinfo01__guide">{{ s.guide_label | escape }}</a>{%- endif -%}
          </div
        ></div
      >{%- endfor -%}
    </div
  ></section
  >{%- endif -%}{%- endif -%}
</div

>

